# Crucible Temperature Lookup
# temp | state          | recommended distortion
0.20   | cold           | bloom
0.40   | cool           | fold
0.60   | balanced       | fold / shear
0.80   | warm           | shear / liquefy
1.00   | hot            | liquefy
1.20   | critical       | liquefy + void dampen
1.40   | supercritical  | emergency fold
